{"id":"7279c20158ac140e","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-substitution-function.md","title":"Substitution Function","display":"df-substitution-function — Substitution Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-substitution-function","aliases":["90-df-substitution-function"],"display":"df-substitution-function — Substitution Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-substitution-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-substitution-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-function — Substitution Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 是有效签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是固定的指定自由变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Expr}(S),\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\operatorname{Expr}(S),\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span>；数码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a>，自由代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>。此固定环境不得在调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> 时更换。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,n,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,n,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>；合法单自由变量类使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\)</span>，不将任意指定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 暗换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nB_{S,g,v}(e,n,z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\ [e=g(\\varphi)\\land z=g(\\varphi[\\overline n/v])]\\\\\n&amp;\\lor[e\\notin g[\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]]\\land z=0],\\\\\n\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&amp;\\exists!z\\in\\mathbb N\\ B_{S,g,v}(e,n,z),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((e,n),z)\\in\\mathbb N^2\\times\\mathbb N:B_{S,g,v}(e,n,z)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S&amp;:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,n)=z&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow B_{S,g,v}(e,n,z).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nB_{S,g,v}(e,n,z)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\ [e=g(\\varphi)\\land z=g(\\varphi[\\overline n/v])]\\\\\n&amp;\\lor[e\\notin g[\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]]\\land z=0],\\\\\n\\forall e,n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&amp;\\exists!z\\in\\mathbb N\\ B_{S,g,v}(e,n,z),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((e,n),z)\\in\\mathbb N^2\\times\\mathbb N:B_{S,g,v}(e,n,z)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S&amp;:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,n)=z&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow B_{S,g,v}(e,n,z).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一分支中的公式见证现在在同一个作用域内绑定，不再以分支条件中的存在变量作为作用域外的项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 单射和闭数码的无捕获代入保证唯一性，第二分支保持原默认值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> 为此图引入的定义性函数扩张；其下标未显示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,v\">\\(g,v\\)</span> 是本文件明确固定的环境常元。合法单自由变量公式码可判定且编码／解码有效，故该函数可计算；其原始递归性仍是额外条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-godel-numberin